<title>UK: M &amp; S to launch mail order service in autumn.</title>
<headline>M &amp; S to launch mail order service in autumn.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marks and Spencer Plc is preparing to launch trials of a mail order clothes service this autumn, the Times newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>The service will be run by Marks &amp; Spencer alone and not as a joint venture, the paper said.</p>
<p>&quot;The company is expected to use its charge card database to target customers,' the Times said.</p>
</text>
